    "verseCount": 6,
    "content": "<p class=\"d\">A Song of Ascents.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 126:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>When Yahweh brought back those who returned to Zion,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 126:1\" class=\"q2\">we were like those who dream.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 126:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>Then our mouth was filled with laughter,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 126:2\" class=\"q2\">and our tongue with singing.</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 126:2\" class=\"q1\">Then they said among the nations,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 126:2\" class=\"q2\">“Yahweh has done great things for them.”</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 126:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>Yahweh has done great things for us,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 126:3\" class=\"q2\">and we are glad.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"4\" data-sid=\"PSA 126:4\" class=\"v\">4</span>Restore our fortunes again, Yahweh,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 126:4\" class=\"q2\">like the streams in the Negev.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"5\" data-sid=\"PSA 126:5\" class=\"v\">5</span>Those who sow in tears will reap in joy.</p><p class=\"q2\"><span data-number=\"6\" data-sid=\"PSA 126:6\" class=\"v\">6</span>He who goes out weeping, carrying seed for sowing,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 126:6\" class=\"q2\">will certainly come again with joy, carrying his sheaves.</p>",
